Short:        Python 3.14 for the Amiga (ixemul)
Author:       spotUP
Uploader:     spotup@gmail.com (spotUP)
Type:         dev/lang
Version:      @VERSION@
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0; m68k-020
Requires:     none (it brings ixemul.library when the system has none)
Distribution: Aminet

Python 3.14 (the python3 program and its library, about 15 MB installed in SYS:Python3). It
stands alone: it needs ixemul.library 47 or newer and brings one (a build of ixemul 80 with
ixnet.library) only when the system has none that new; an ixemul.library of 47 or newer that
is there stays as it is, UP-Term's patched one (comm/term/up-term.lha) included. Python3: is
assigned to the drawer at every boot.

Install: unpack, double-click Install. Uninstall removes the drawer, the assign and the
ixemul.library this archive installed, unless another package still needs it.

Licence: Python Software Foundation licence; ixemul.library under its own (LICENSES.txt).
